    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Omanah, a mysterious and contemplative journey inspired by Myst-like classics, blending free exploration with the immersive atmosphere of a walking simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Omanah, set out to explore 9 unique worlds, each filled with secrets and puzzles to solve. Enjoy total freedom of movement in realistic environments designed for immersion and wonder. The accessible and varied puzzles are randomly generated each time you play, ensuring a fresh experience with every exploration.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omanah is available in 7 languages and offers 30 Steam achievements for collectors and challenge seekers. Gather objects, observe, think, and let yourself be carried away by the captivating atmosphere of each place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - 9 worlds to explore freely, each with its own identity and secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Fully free movement in realistic 3D environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Accessible, randomized puzzles for maximum replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Available in 7 languages for a global experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - 30 Steam achievements to unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Perfect for fans of Myst-likes, walking simulators, and contemplative adventures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omanah invites you to take your time, observe, solve, and above all, marvel. Are you ready to open the door to the unknown?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Omanah, a mysterious and contemplative journey inspired by Myst-like classics, blending free exploration with the immersive atmosphere of a walking simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Omanah, set out to explore 9 unique worlds, each filled with secrets and puzzles to solve. Enjoy total freedom of movement in realistic environments designed for immersion and wonder. The accessible and varied puzzles are randomly generated each time you play, ensuring a fresh experience with every exploration.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omanah is available in 7 languages and offers 30 Steam achievements for collectors and challenge seekers. Gather objects, observe, think, and let yourself be carried away by the captivating atmosphere of each place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - 9 worlds to explore freely, each with its own identity and secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Fully free movement in realistic 3D environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Accessible, randomized puzzles for maximum replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Available in 7 languages for a global experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - 30 Steam achievements to unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    - Perfect for fans of Myst-likes, walking simulators, and contemplative adventures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Omanah invites you to take your time, observe, solve, and above all, marvel. Are you ready to open the door to the unknown?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
